(   x^2*\(d^2u/dx^2\) + 2xy*\(d^2u/dxdy\) + y^2*\(d^2u/dy^2\) = G\(u\),) Tj
T*
(   where G\(u\) = F\(u\) * [ F'\(u\) - 1 ].) Tj
T*
(   - Compute F'\(u\):) Tj
T*
(   F'\(u\) = d/du [ \(1/2\)*tan\(u\) ] = \(1/2\) * sec^2\(u\).) Tj
T*
(   - Compute G\(u\):) Tj
T*
(   G\(u\) = \(1/2\)*tan\(u\) * [ \(1/2\)*sec^2\(u\) - 1 ]) Tj
T*
(   = \(1/2\)*tan\(u\) * [ \(1 - 2*cos^2\(u\)\) / \(2*cos^2\(u\)\) ]) Tj
T*
(   = \(1/4\)*tan\(u\) * [ -cos\(2u\) / cos^2\(u\) ]) Tj
T*
(   = - \(1/4\) * tan\(u\) * cos\(2u\) / cos^2\(u\). \(Part ii proved\).) Tj
