(   = \(cos theta\)*\(r * cos theta\) - \(-r * sin theta\)*\(sin theta\)) Tj
T*
(   = r * cos^2 theta + r * sin^2 theta = r * \(cos^2 theta + sin^2 theta\) = r.) Tj
T*
(   - Inverse Transformation: r = sqrt\(x^2 + y^2\), theta = arctan\(y / x\).) Tj
T*
(   - Compute J' = d\(r, theta\) / d\(x, y\):) Tj
T*
(   dr/dx = x / sqrt\(x^2 + y^2\) = \(r * cos theta\) / r = cos theta.) Tj
T*
(   dr/dy = y / sqrt\(x^2 + y^2\) = \(r * sin theta\) / r = sin theta.) Tj
T*
(   dtheta/dx = -y / \(x^2 + y^2\) = \(-r * sin theta\) / r^2 = -sin theta / r.) Tj
T*
(   dtheta/dy = x / \(x^2 + y^2\) = \(r * cos theta\) / r^2 = cos theta / r.) Tj
T*
(   J' = det\([ cos theta, sin theta; -sin theta / r, cos theta / r ]\)) Tj
T*
(   = \(cos theta\)*\(cos theta / r\) - \(sin theta\)*\(-sin theta / r\)) Tj
T*
(   = \(cos^2 theta + sin^2 theta\) / r = 1 / r.) Tj
T*
(   - Verify product:) Tj
T*
(   J * J' = r * \(1 / r\) = 1.) Tj
T*
(   Confirmed.) Tj
