T*
(   fy = 3y^2 - 3ax = 3*\(y^2 - ax\).) Tj
T*
(   Step 2: Stationary Points \(fx = 0 and fy = 0\):) Tj
T*
(   From fx = 0: x^2 = ay => y = x^2 / a.) Tj
T*
(   Substitute into fy = 0:) Tj
T*
(   3 * [ \(x^2 / a\)^2 - ax ] = 0) Tj
T*
(   => x^4 / a^2 - ax = 0 => x^4 - a^3 * x = 0) Tj
T*
(   => x * \(x^3 - a^3\) = 0.) Tj
T*
(   Real roots: x = 0 and x = a.) Tj
T*
(   - If x = 0: y = 0^2 / a = 0. Stationary point P1\(0, 0\).) Tj
T*
(   - If x = a: y = a^2 / a = a. Stationary point P2\(a, a\).) Tj
