T*
(   At \(0, 0\):) Tj
T*
(   r = 0, s = -3a, t = 0.) Tj
T*
(   Delta = 36\(0\)\(0\) - 9a^2 = -9a^2.) Tj
T*
(   Since a > 0, Delta = -9a^2 < 0.) Tj
T*
(   Therefore, the origin P1\(0, 0\) is a SADDLE POINT.) Tj
T*
(   Step 5: Classification of Point P2\(a, a\):) Tj
T*
(   At \(a, a\):) Tj
T*
(   r = 6a > 0 \(since a > 0\).) Tj
T*
(   s = -3a.) Tj
T*
(   t = 6a.) Tj
T*
(   Delta = \(6a\)*\(6a\) - \(-3a\)^2 = 36a^2 - 9a^2 = 27a^2 > 0.) Tj
T*
(   Since Delta = 27a^2 > 0 and r = 6a > 0:) Tj
T*
(   f attains a strict LOCAL MINIMUM at P2\(a, a\).) Tj
T*
(   Minimum value:) Tj
T*
(   f_min = f\(a, a\) = a^3 + a^3 - 3a\(a\)\(a\) = 2a^3 - 3a^3 = -a^3.) Tj
