(   1. Thermodynamic Potentials and Fundamental Equations:) Tj
T*
(   - Internal Energy U\(S, V\): dU = T*dS - P*dV.) Tj
T*
(   - Enthalpy H\(S, P\): dH = T*dS + V*dP.) Tj
T*
(   - Helmholtz Free Energy A\(T, V\): dA = -S*dT - P*dV.) Tj
T*
(   - Gibbs Free Energy G\(T, P\): dG = -S*dT + V*dP.) Tj
T*
(   2. Derivation of Maxwell Relation 1 \(from U\):) Tj
T*
(   - From dU = T*dS - P*dV:) Tj
T*
(   \(dU/dS\)_V = T and \(dU/dV\)_S = -P.) Tj
T*
(   - By Clairaut's Theorem, mixed partials commute: d^2U / dVdS = d^2U / dSdV.) Tj
T*
(   d/dV [ \(dU/dS\)_V ]_S = d/dS [ \(dU/dV\)_S ]_V) Tj
T*
(   => \(dT / dV\)_S = - \(dP / dS\)_V. \(Relation 1\).) Tj
T*
(   3. Derivation of Maxwell Relation 2 \(from H\):) Tj
T*
(   - From dH = T*dS + V*dP:) Tj
T*
(   \(dH/dS\)_P = T and \(dH/dP\)_S = V.) Tj
T*
(   - Equating mixed partials: d^2H / dPdS = d^2H / dSdP:) Tj
T*
(   d/dP [ \(dH/dS\)_P ]_S = d/dS [ \(dH/dP\)_S ]_P) Tj
T*
(   => \(dT / dP\)_S = \(dV / dS\)_P. \(Relation 2\).) Tj
T*
(   4. Derivation of Maxwell Relation 3 \(from A\):) Tj
T*
(   - From dA = -S*dT - P*dV:) Tj
T*
(   \(dA/dT\)_V = -S and \(dA/dV\)_T = -P.) Tj
T*
(   - Equating mixed partials: d^2A / dVdT = d^2A / dTdV:) Tj
T*
(   d/dV [ -S ]_T = d/dT [ -P ]_V) Tj
T*
(   => \(dS / dV\)_T = \(dP / dT\)_V. \(Relation 3\).) Tj
T*
(   5. Derivation of Maxwell Relation 4 \(from G\):) Tj
T*
(   - From dG = -S*dT + V*dP:) Tj
T*
(   \(dG/dT\)_P = -S and \(dG/dP\)_T = V.) Tj
T*
(   - Equating mixed partials: d^2G / dPdT = d^2G / dTdP:) Tj
T*
(   d/dP [ -S ]_T = d/dT [ V ]_P) Tj
T*
(   => - \(dS / dP\)_T = \(dV / dT\)_P, or \(dS / dP\)_T = - \(dV / dT\)_P. \(Relation 4\).) Tj
T*
(   Conclusion:) Tj
T*
(   Maxwell's relations permit the calculation of experimentally inaccessible entropy changes) Tj
T*
(   \(dS/dP\) from measurable volumetric thermal expansion coefficients \(dV/dT\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
